  "title": "Alpha Tau Announces First-Ever Oral Presentation of Alpha DaRT® Pancreatic Cancer Data at Digestive Disease Week (DDW) 2026",
  "summary": "Jerusalem, March 31, 2026 – Alpha Tau Medical Ltd. (Nasdaq: DRTS, DRTSW) (“Alpha Tau”), the developer of the innovative alpha-radiation cancer therapy Alpha DaRT® today announced that an abstract presenting results of two clinical trials in Jerusalem in patients with pancreatic cancer has been accepted for an oral presentation at Digestive Disease Week (DDW) 2026, […]",
